            "review_title": "Review at Song Bar",
            "review_text": "SCOTT G\nPerth, Australia50 contributions\n0\nAmazing View, Amazing Service\nMay 2026 • Solo\nFrom the moment you walk out of the elevator towards this bar you have a feeling of being in an exclusive lounge bar. Half price cocktails are a bonus and so is the amazing view. Along with the amazing view, I received amazing first class service from Sunnie. She is a star and asset to this bar. Her attitude and attention to detail makes you feel welcome. Well done to management for having a great team.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2026\nLinh T\nDear SCOTT G,\n\nThank you for the stellar review of Song Bar and your great compliments to Sunnie. We are most happy that you enjoyed our evening, and the quality of food and service exceeded your expectation. We look forward to welcoming you back soon for another memorable meal with us.\n\nKind Regards\nSong Bar Team\nRead more\nWritten May 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
