            "review_text": "Stephen H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam63 contributions\n0\nGreat view, weak cocktails, good for smokers\nMay 2025 • Couples\nIt’s a nice view. 2 for one cocktails looked appealing so we ordered. The cocktails were watery and inconsistent in flavour. Seemed to be diluted and only with a little alcohol, perhaps that’s to ensure the 2 for 1 is actually 1, but in 2 glasses. Either way, not great cocktails. Was a pleasant evening though, until a spiteful cigar smoker appeared and we had to leave. The bar allow smoking anywhere outside, which ruins things for non smokers. We asked if there was a non smoking area - there isn’t. Hilton really need to get with the 21st century, and either ban smoking or at least have specific areas where non-smokers can sit. Needless to say the venue was quite empty - unusual in Saigon for a Friday night, but i can understand why. We won’t be back in a hurry.\nRead more\nWritten May 24, 2025",
